real schema field consumed inside `prepareDerivedData()`'s `this.defenses.fortitude` calculation, so
an effect targeting it lands at the right phase, whereas targeting `system.defenses.fortitude`
directly would get silently overwritten moments later when `prepareDerivedData()` reruns. Gating
"only while Signature" has no native Foundry equivalent (transfer is unconditional), so `disabled`
is toggled manually via `createItem`/`updateItem` hooks in `essence.mjs` instead of trying to
create/delete the effect document itself. Explicitly scoped to plain (non-modular) equipment only —
